Looking for audio visual rental for weddings in Malaga? A wedding needs one thing above all else from its AV: nothing going wrong during the vows. Sound that reaches every guest, a wireless mic for speeches, and a technician on site to catch a feedback loop before anyone notices it.

Malaga Event Gear delivers, installs and tests that setup across Malaga and the wider Costa del Sol.

Contact us today to discuss your wedding.

## Brief Overview

---

Malaga Event Gear's [Wedding Pack](/packages/wedding/) covers the AV side of your day: PA sound for up to 80 guests, fairy-light ambient lighting, wireless microphones for vows and speeches, and a live technician on site throughout. Backed by experience going back to 1996, we deliver, install and test the equipment ourselves.

Contact us today to discuss your wedding.

## Key Highlights

---

The [Wedding Pack](/packages/wedding/) is built specifically for wedding-day AV.

-   High-end active PA sound for up to 80 guests, sized for a villa, finca or wedding hotel.

-   Fairy lights and warm LED strings for romantic ambient lighting, not a stage rig.

-   Wireless microphones for vows, speeches and announcements, not a corded mic tying anyone to a stand.

-   A live technician on site throughout, watching for feedback and adjusting sound during the banquet and speeches.

## Why the Technician Matters at a Wedding

Most of our packages don't include a technician standard; the Wedding Pack does, alongside only the MICE Pack. At a wedding, that matters more than at almost any other event: vows and speeches happen once, live, in front of everyone who matters to you. A technician on site catches a microphone feedback loop or a dropped connection before it becomes the thing people remember.

