## What's Included, at 650 Euros

The [Wedding Pack](/packages/wedding/) costs 650 euros, ex VAT, and includes PA sound for up to 80 guests, fairy-light ambient lighting, wireless microphones, transport, professional setup, and a live technician for the event. See full details on our [packages page](/packages/).

## What We Provide, and What We Don't

We provide sound, lighting and microphones for the ceremony and reception. We do not provide a projector, screen or LED display: the Wedding Pack has none, since a wedding rarely needs one. We also do not provide décor, furniture or dancefloor accessories: for those, look at a dedicated event decor or furniture rental company. Our [wedding rentals](/blog/wedding-rentals/) guide covers the same audio visual side of your day in more depth, not decor or furniture.

