## FAQs

### What AV equipment do I need for a wedding?

PA sound sized to your guest count, a wireless microphone for vows and speeches, and ambient lighting. The [Wedding Pack](/packages/wedding/) covers all three, with a technician on site. See [Why the Technician Matters at a Wedding](#why-the-technician-matters-at-a-wedding) above.

### How much does audio visual rental cost for a wedding?

The Wedding Pack costs 650 euros, ex VAT, with 21 percent Spanish VAT added at checkout. The price includes delivery, setup and teardown. See exact pricing on our [packages page](/packages/).

### Is a technician included for a wedding?

Yes. The Wedding Pack includes a live technician on site throughout the event, one of only two packages in our catalog that does.

### How many guests can the Wedding Pack support?

Up to 80 guests. For a larger wedding, [contact us](/contact/) to discuss options.

### Do you provide a projector or screen for a wedding?

No, the Wedding Pack does not include one. It is built around sound, lighting and microphones for the ceremony and reception.

### Can we add a smoke or fog machine to the Wedding Pack?

Yes, a professional smoke/fog machine is available as a paid add on for 20 euros, ex VAT, the same real unit we offer across our packages, for a first dance or a cake cutting moment. [Contact us](/contact/) to add it when you book.

### Do you provide wedding decor, furniture or dancefloor accessories?

No, those are not part of our AV packages. See our [wedding rentals](/blog/wedding-rentals/) guide for the full range beyond AV.

### How far in advance should I book AV for a wedding?

Wedding dates fill up quickly, so book as early as you can once your date and venue are confirmed. Our services are available in Malaga and extend to Granada for rentals over 400 euros.
